preted as `CallExpression: first` for object and array arguments.\r\n\r\n**Is there anything you'd like reviewers to focus on?**\r\n\r\nI think we should add some additional fixtures or smoketests to the indent rule, even if the fixture contains a large codebase in itself. The rule has several hundred tests, but it seems like we're still missing cases. If we add more fixtures, we can be more confident that a particular change isn't going to break anything.\r\n\r\nAlso, I'm wondering if it would be possible to separate out the breaking parts of https://github.com/eslint/eslint/pull/7618 and land the indent rewrite without waiting for a major update. It looks like the indent rule is getting difficult to effectively maintain -- we've broken things the last few times we've tried to change it.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/7734/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/7734/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/266143782","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/7733#issuecomment-266143782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/7733","id":266143782,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI2NjE0Mzc4Mg==","user":{"login":"roastlechon","id":1642212,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDIyMTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1642212?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roastlechon","html_url":"https://github.com/roastlechon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roastlechon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roastlechon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roastlechon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roastlechon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscri